 a bit blind!"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So I laugh at myself, at these whimsical thoughts,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "I play with my ideas, even if they\u2019re fraught."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "For in this world that\u2019s so serious,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Reflex ideas are my little game, so curious!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}